
======================================================================
GeneTraceAI — Full Pipeline
======================================================================
  [  ] Stage 0: 00_harmonisation       Check warehouse exists
  [  ] Stage 1: 01_Transcriptomics     RNA z-scores (transcriptomics.py, full genome)  ~2h
  [  ] Stage 2: 02_Proteinomics        Protein tier + z-scores (M2)              ~15-20 min
  [  ] Stage 3: 03_Altercations        Mutations + Fusions + CNA scoring
  [  ] Stage 4: Scoring                core_score + driver routing + tiers
  [  ] Stage 5: Ranking                Evidence ledger (all pairs)
  [  ] Stage 6: Validation             Held-out evaluation (hit@20)
  [  ] Stage 7: Testing                Diagnostic tests on outputs


